OL,3,GNEWSAAllergy label law delay is 'a
OL,4,Aticking time bomb'
OL,5,
OL,6,FFood allergy campaigners have expressed
OL,7,Fconcern about delays to the
OL,8,Fimplementation of a law on labelling
OL,9,Fpre-packaged food in Jersey.
OL,11,FIts introduction was agreed in 2022,
OL,12,Fbut has been repeatedly delayed since
OL,13,F2024 - the latest due to government
OL,14,Fwanting to continue to talk to
OL,15,Fbusinesses about the changes.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
