OL,3,GNEWSAAllergy label law delay is 'a
OL,4,Aticking time bomb'
OL,5,
OL,6,FNadim Ednan-Laperouse, whose daughter
OL,7,FNatasha died of an allergic reaction in
OL,8,F2016 after eating a sandwich she bought
OL,9,Fat Heathrow Airport containing sesame
OL,10,Fwith no allergy label, said Jersey
OL,11,Fneeded to follow the UK in bringing a
OL,12,Flaw in before a fatal tragedy happens.
OL,14,FA Government of Jersey spokesperson
OL,15,Fsaid the minister responsible supported
OL,16,Fthe law's implementation in this States
OL,17,Fterm.
